m cho da, phù hợp với mọi loại da.\u003cbr /\u003e- Sản phẩm tạo bọt mịn, nhẹ nhàng chăm sóc đôi bàn tay bằng cách làm sạch vết bẩn và tế bào chết trên da.\u003cbr /\u003e- Hương thơm quý phái giúp khử mùi toàn diện cho đôi tay hoàn toàn sạch sẽ, mềm mại và thơm mát.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHƯƠNG TÁO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/7f/75/63/e9a4b6226c642cee71dfe3c1aff57e38.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"699\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHƯƠNG DÂU\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/a3/b2/37/92428c3d00e13704aee675f91dadd51c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"662\" /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #993366;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHƯƠNG QUẾ\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #993366;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/b7/0a/53/d414af1275443ee4947cdcde5f178e61.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"702\" /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiá sản phẩm trên Tiki đã bao gồ